## Registry README policy

Public package readmes must **not** use the repository root `README.md`:

| Surface | Readme file |
|---------|-------------|
| PyPI | `README.pypi.md` (`pyproject.toml` → `readme`) |
| npm | `nodejs/README.md` (`package.json` → `readme`) |
| crates.io (future) | `rust/README.md` (`Cargo.toml` → `readme`) |

The GitHub repo README is for contributors and clone UX only.

